  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil. Add the rice and cook for 25 mins or until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381129/photos/large/prep_ingredients-bcea374613e31f265062dd82b370de81.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast eggplant: Meanwhile, cut the eggplant into 2cm chunks. Thinly slice the spring onions, keeping the white and green parts separate. Combine the eggplant, white part of the spring onion, miso, 1 tbs vegetable oil, 1 tbs dijon mustard and 2 tsp honey in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper. Put on the lined tray and roast for 15 mins or until softened and slightly charred.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381130/photos/large/cook_rice-a66be02f3280fbd9aef6232bdb76d4e7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: While the eggplant is roasting, peel the carrot, then shred using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater. Thinly slice the radish. Halve the tofu pieces.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381131/photos/large/roast_eggpplant-fe88d1f1fe973f2505646d473160c6be.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tofu: Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the tofu, turning occasionally, for 4 mins or until golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381132/photos/large/cook_tofu-bba7039f17e94064dd4adea8d3429f46.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Combine the carrot, radish, remaining spring onion, 2 tsp soy sauce and 1 tbs white vinegar in a bowl. Divide the rice among bowls, top with the eggplant and tofu and spoon over any tray juices. Serve with the carrot salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381133/photos/large/serve_up-8e19f7ef215914bfa760cf449a19c0d0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Got some sesame seeds on hand? Sprinkle over the top for extra nutty flavour and crunch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/381134/photos/large/make_it_yours-3eb245646131889caae61639f2ea6550.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
